steps.action:
At the same URL, send PUT with No Auth, Content-Type: application/json and a raw JSON body:
{"configurationControl":"local"}
Poll GET config every two seconds for up to 10 seconds to confirm the setting has changed.

Send PUT at the same URL with the same headers and a raw JSON body:
{"cloudConnection":true,"measurementInterval":10}
Poll GET config every two seconds for up to 10 seconds to confirm the settings have changed.

At the same URL, send PUT with No Auth, Content-Type: application/json and a raw JSON body:
{"configurationControl":"local"}
Poll GET config every two seconds for up to 10 seconds to confirm the setting has changed.

Send PUT config at the same URL with the same headers and a raw JSON body:
{"cloudConnection":true,"configurationControl":"both"}
Poll GET config every two seconds for up to 10 seconds to confirm the settings have changed. Observe Home for up to 90 seconds after the PUT.

Send PUT config at the same URL with the same headers and a raw JSON body:
{"configurationControl":"local"}
Poll GET config every two seconds for up to 10 seconds to confirm the setting has changed.

Enable local authority. In the API client, send PUT http://airgradient_<serial>.local/api/v1/config with No Auth and header Content-Type: application/json. Select a raw JSON body and paste:
{"configurationControl":"local"}
Then send GET http://airgradient_<serial>.local/api/v1/config in the API client with No Auth and no body every five seconds for at most 20 seconds after Send.

Enable the normal OTA service while keeping cloud configuration changes disabled. In the API client, send PUT http://airgradient_<serial>.local/api/v1/config with No Auth and header Content-Type: application/json. Select a raw JSON body and paste:
{"cloudConnection":true,"measurementInterval":10}
Then send GET http://airgradient_<serial>.local/api/v1/config in the API client with No Auth and no body every five seconds for at most 20 seconds after Send.

cleanup:
With the saved original configuration available, return to Stationary. In the API client, send PUT http://airgradient_<serial>.local/api/v1/config with No Auth and header Content-Type: application/json. Select a raw JSON body and paste:
{"configurationControl":"local"}
Then send GET http://airgradient_<serial>.local/api/v1/config in the API client with No Auth and no body every five seconds for at most 20 seconds after Send. Confirm configurationControl is local before restoring values.

